    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this lead:\n\nName: {{$json.name}}\nEmail: {{$json.email}}\nCompany: {{$json.company}}\nJob Title: {{$json.jobTitle}}\nInterest: {{$json.interest}}\nBudget: {{$json.budget}}\nTimeline: {{$json.timeline}}\nCompany Size: {{$json.company_size}}\nRequirements: {{ $json.body.requirements }}\nMessage: {{ $json.body.message }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an AI Lead Qualification and Sales Agent.\n\nYour job is to analyze incoming sales leads and determine how qualified they are.\n\nAnalyze:\n\n1. Lead information\n2. Product/service interest\n3. Budget\n4. Buying timeline\n5. Job role\n6. Company size\n7. Requirements\n8. Buying intent\n9. Pain points\n10. Missing information\n\nClassify the lead as:\n\nHOT = strong buying intent, suitable budget, clear requirement and near-term timeline.\n\nWARM = potential customer but some qualification information or buying commitment is missing.\n\nCOLD = low buying intent, unclear requirement, no budget, or very distant timeline.\n\nDo not invent information that is not provided.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"leadName\": \"\",\n  \"email\": \"\",\n  \"company\": \"\",\n  \"jobTitle\": \"\",\n  \"interest\": \"\",\n  \"budget\": \"\",\n  \"timeline\": \"\",\n  \"leadScore\": 0,\n  \"leadCategory\": \"\",\n  \"buyingIntent\": \"\",\n  \"qualification\": \"\",\n  \"keyRequirements\": [],\n  \"painPoints\": [],\n  \"missingInformation\": [],\n  \"recommendedAction\": \"\",\n  \"salesMessage\": \"\"\n}\n\nleadScore must be between 0 and 100.\n\nleadCategory must be exactly one of:\nHOT\nWARM\nCOLD\n\nbuyingIntent must be:\nHigh\nMedium\nLow\n\nqualification must be:\nQualified\nPartially Qualified\nNot Qualified\n\nThe salesMessage should be a short, professional personalized sales follow-up message."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        16,
        -32
      ],
      "id": "ee9583ba-8fac-427e-921d-4bac31863606",
      "name": "AI Agent"
